          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best protein powder for a Ninja Creami is the one that thickens before it freezes. A whey-casein blend such as PEScience Select or Quest is the easiest route to a creamy pint; a micellar casein such as Optimum Nutrition or Dymatize is the thickest, best used with plenty of milk or as half the scoop; and a gum-rich whey like Premier works with a spoon of pudding mix and a re-spin. Keep a clear whey around for sorbet.
          </p>
